16. How each goal ended - the state is a BridgeGoalState: 4 succeeded, 5 canceled, 7 rejected
=============================================================================================
sends goal 1 to action 'A1'
goal 1 on 'A1' (urn:goal:1) ended, state 4
sends goal 2 to action 'A2'
goal 2 on 'A2' (urn:goal:2) ended, state 5
sends goal 3 to action 'A3'
goal 3 on 'A3' (urn:goal:3) ended, state 7
sends goal 4 to action 'A4'

